{"id": "16-2036-2-5", "zh": "saṃdhā：用于“连结”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2036-6-12", "zh": "带前缀 saṃ 的词根 dhā 用于“连结”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2036-13-21", "zh": "玛蒂既不对他皱眉，也不心怀芥蒂，也不哭泣。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2036-22-31", "zh": "这里的 na **sandhiyati**（不心怀芥蒂），是其他论著所没有的 divādi 类变化形。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2037-2-4", "zh": "dhanu：用于“乞求”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2037-5-13", "zh": "伊兰达蒂啊，你的母亲渴求着毗度罗的心。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2037-14-18", "zh": "这也是其他论著所没有的 divādi 类变化形。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2038-2-4", "zh": "dhī：用于“轻视”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2038-5-6", "zh": "dhīyate（被轻视）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2038-7-8", "zh": "dhīno（被轻视的）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2039-2-4", "zh": "yudha：用于“交战”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2039-5-6", "zh": "yujjhati（作战）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2039-7-24", "zh": "yodho（战士）、yuddhaṃ（战斗）、caraṇāyudho；如果把字母 ya 变成 va，就有 āvudhaṃ（武器）这一形式。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2039-25-29", "zh": "其中，**以足为武器者**（caraṇāyudho）是指公鸡。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2040-2-4", "zh": "kudha：用于“发怒”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2040-5-6", "zh": "kujjhati（发怒）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2040-7-12", "zh": "kodho（愤怒）、kujjhanā（发怒）、kujjhitattaṃ（发怒的状态）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2040-13-22", "zh": "发怒的人不懂得利益，发怒的人看不见法。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2041-2-4", "zh": "sudha：用于“清净”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2041-5-7", "zh": "soceyya 就是清净的状态。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2041-8-9", "zh": "sujjhati（变得清净）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2041-10-21", "zh": "suddhi、visuddhi、sujjhanaṃ（清净），suddho、visuddho、parisuddho（清净的）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2041-22-31", "zh": "在使役形中有 sodheti（使清净）、sodhako（净化者）等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2042-2-4", "zh": "sidhu：用于“成就”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2042-5-6", "zh": "sijjhati（得以成就）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2042-7-8", "zh": "siddhi（成就）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2043-2-4", "zh": "radha：用于“伤害”义。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2043-5-10", "zh": "rajjhati、virajjhati、aparajjhati（犯过错）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2043-11-12", "zh": "aparādho（过失）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2044-2-5", "zh": "rādha、sādha：用于“成办”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2044-6-9", "zh": "rādhayati、sādhayati（成办）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2044-10-13", "zh": "ārādhanaṃ（成就）、sādhanaṃ（成办）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2044-14-19", "zh": "能成办自己和他人的利益，所以叫作 sādhu，也就是善人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2044-20-27", "zh": "应当彻底成办，所以叫作 sādhu，也就是所获得的、美好的布施、持戒等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2045-2-4", "zh": "vidha：用于“穿刺”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2045-5-6", "zh": "vijjhati（射穿）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2045-7-8", "zh": "paṭivijjhati（通达）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2045-9-31", "zh": "khaṇa viddha、vidhu、vijjhanako（射穿者）、viddho（被射中的）、paṭividdho（被通达的）、vijjhanaṃ、vedho（射穿）、paṭivedho（通达）、vijjhitvā、viddhā、viddhāna（射穿之后）。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "16-2045-32-36", "zh": "是谁射中我之后躲藏起来？", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2046-2-4", "zh": "idha：用于“增长”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2046-5-8", "zh": "ijjhati、samijjhati（成功、兴盛）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2046-9-16", "zh": "iddhi（成就）、ijjhanaṃ、samijjhanaṃ（成功）、iddho（兴盛的）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2046-17-22", "zh": "其中，**成就**（iddhi）：成功就叫作成就。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2046-23-32", "zh": "或者，众生凭借它而成功、增长、达到卓越，所以叫作成就。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2047-2-5", "zh": "gidhu：用于“贪求”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2047-6-9", "zh": "gijjhati（贪求）、gijjho（秃鹫）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2047-10-11", "zh": "gaddho（贪求的）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "16-2047-12-13", "zh": "gaddhabādhipubbo（从前是驯鹰者）。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "16-2047-14-17", "zh": "你贪着欲乐，所以不明白。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2047-18-19", "zh": "gedho（贪着）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2048-2-4", "zh": "rudhi：用于“遮障”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2048-5-10", "zh": "rujjhati（阻碍）、virujjhati（敌对）、paṭivirujjhati（反抗）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2048-11-14", "zh": "virodhako（敌对者）、viruddho（相违的）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2048-15-22", "zh": "rodho（阻碍）、virodho（敌对）、paṭivirodho（反抗）、anuvirodho（违逆）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2049-2-4", "zh": "anuvidhā：用于“仿效”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2049-5-11", "zh": "带前缀 anu、vi 的词根 dhā 用于“仿效行为”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2049-12-19", "zh": "一个人仿效另一个人的行为。关于这一点，有这样的圣典：", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2050-2-8", "zh": "“萨摩王那匹灰白的马，被吉利达多带坏了；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2051-2-10", "zh": "它舍弃了原来的本性，就去模仿他。”", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2052-2-7", "zh": "这也是其他论著所没有的 divādi 类变化形。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2053-2-4", "zh": "anurudha：用于“欲求”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2053-5-7", "zh": "kāma 就是愿求。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2053-8-14", "zh": "带前缀 anu 的词根 rudha 用于“愿求”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2053-15-18", "zh": "anuruddho（随欲者）、anurodho（随顺）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2053-19-22", "zh": "为什么要说带 anu？因为不带 anu 就成了 virodho（敌对）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "16-2054-2-11", "zh": "其中，**随欲者**（anuruddho）：他追随、欲求一件又一件殊胜的事物，所以叫作随欲者。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "16-2054-12-15", "zh": "**随顺**（anurodho）就是顺从。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2054-16-30", "zh": "圣典是这样说的：“他迎合已经得到的利养，没有利养时就抵触。”", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2055-2-4", "zh": "byadha：用于“打击”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2055-5-6", "zh": "byajjhati（打击）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2055-7-8", "zh": "byādho（猎人）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2055-9-12", "zh": "**猎人**（byādho）就是捕猎的人。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2055-13-20", "zh": "他击打、伤害各种野兽，所以叫作猎人。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2056-2-4", "zh": "gudha：用于“缠绕”义。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2056-5-6", "zh": "gujjhati（缠绕）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "16-2056-7-8", "zh": "godhā（巨蜥）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2057-2-4", "zh": "mana：用于“认知”义。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2057-5-10", "zh": "maññati（认为）、avamaññati（轻视）、atimaññati（傲视）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "16-2057-11-14", "zh": "以“我比他好”等方式来自我认定，所以叫作慢（māno）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "16-2057-15-36", "zh": "“自认、自认的状态、慢、我执、自高、举旗、高举、自负”，这些都是同义词。", "confidence": 70}
